	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d08r0901_dstone_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>バッグの　なか……
ダークストーンが　うごめいている！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:37:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:37:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>バッグの　なか……
ダークストーンが　うごめいている！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:37:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:37:55" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>システム
・BLACK２ver
・posで表示
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
・はい　→
・いいえ→</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T02:41:35" />
		</CommentCell>
